@startuml
title S2  Read, replace and clear preferences  US-03
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontColor #172A3A
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam ArrowColor #345A72
skinparam Shadowing false
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam TitleFontColor #123A52
skinparam TitleFontSize 19
skinparam ClassBackgroundColor #EDF5FA
skinparam ClassBorderColor #456F89
skinparam ComponentBackgroundColor #EDF5FA
skinparam ComponentBorderColor #456F89
skinparam PackageBorderColor #456F89
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #E6F4F0
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #417364
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor #EDF5FA
skinparam SequenceGroupBorderColor #617C8D
hide footbox
autonumber
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
actor User
participant "Web UI" as UI
participant "Protected routes" as API

participant PreferenceService as Pref
participant "profiles: ProfileRepository" as Profiles
participant "tx: UnitOfWork" as Tx
User -> UI : open profile or save both lists
UI -> API : GET or PUT /profile/preferences
ref over API : S8: obtain owner or end with 401
alt GET
  API -> Pref : read(owner)
  Pref -> Profiles : read(owner)
  Profiles --> Pref : PreferenceProfile (empty arrays if unset)
  Pref --> API : PreferenceProfile
  API --> UI : 200 profile
else PUT
  API -> Pref : replace(owner, dietary, allergens)
  Pref -> Pref : validate the two string arrays
  alt invalid lists
    Pref --> API : validation error
    API --> UI : 400
  else valid lists
    group Write transaction
      Pref -> Tx : begin(WRITE)
      Pref -> Profiles : replaceBoth(owner, profile)
      Profiles --> Pref : saved PreferenceProfile
      Pref -> Tx : commit()
      Tx --> Pref : committed
    end
    Pref --> API : PreferenceProfile
    API --> UI : 200 saved profile
  end
end
note over Pref, Profiles : Preserve list order, repeats and original strings. Empty arrays clear the lists.
@enduml
